,"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on Wagoner County&rsquo;s 8 grids runs from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years, and in 2025 it landed at 42% of normal. On the middle, 2026 opened with January to February at 39% of normal. Grid 19037 had its driest year in 1954 at 54% of normal.</p>"}
